    "title": "Troy man dies after multi-vehicle wreck in Pike County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WAKA Action 8 News ,\n1 days ago PIKE COUNTY, Ala. (WAKA) – A Troy man has died of injuries he suffered in a multi-vehicle wreck earlier this month in Pike County. Alabama State Troopers say 57-year-old Ronald Bradley died Wednesday, September 23, at Baptist Medical Center South in Montgomery following the crash, which happened on Tuesday, September 15. Read full article",
